, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:02:00.09,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're approaching the exit.Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Going straight down, full steam ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.89,0:02:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.89,0:02:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.64,0:02:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Whaaaat?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.25,0:02:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, the sea train has emerged!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.09,0:02:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys! We're fighting, too!Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.34,0:02:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.01,0:02:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jump, Sodom and Gomorrah!Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.30,0:02:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.35,0:02:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.48,0:02:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the entire Franky Family,Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.52,0:02:52.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,thank you for taking us along!Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire the connection cannons!Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.54,0:03:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Cool!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are some top-of-the-line king bulls.Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.84,0:03:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not bad!Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.05,0:03:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Those bastards...!Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey dumbasses, watch it!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Thanks for your help! – Thanks for your help!Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.85,0:03:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the tracks have drifted quite a bit.Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.69,0:03:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I've watched over the sea train from day one.Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.36,0:03:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see it!Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Urgent message from the engine room!Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.37,0:03:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a moment, the train will get on the railway and accelerate rapidly!Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.46,0:03:54.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight if you want to keep injuries to a minimum!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, we're getting hurt no matter what?Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Behave!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma, that was so, so close!Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A little to the right!Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.69,0:04:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see!Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make it next–Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney! Gonbe!Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.78,0:04:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two snuck on board?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep, we did!Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud!Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get inside!Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be blown away!Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're okay! We're okay!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.72,0:04:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.14,0:04:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Don't let go!Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.23,0:04:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow away!Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.94,0:04:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a sec, okay?Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll stop the train right away!Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The brake doesn't work on this train!Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck? That looks kinda fun.Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.83,0:05:14.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat guy!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.71,0:05:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi!Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.75,0:05:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! Hurry and get Chimney and Gonbe inside!Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.05,0:05:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we get on the railway, they'll be blown away!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.18,0:05:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.26,0:06:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I thought I was a goner. – I thought I was a goner.Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously! Good grief!Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.85,0:06:09.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said you'd get blown away!Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.68,0:06:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.81,0:06:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That acceleration sure was crazy.Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.94,0:06:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly...Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really, that scared me!Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hit my lower back.Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.40,0:06:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.69,0:06:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got some unexpected company.Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! Who are they?! – What?! Who are they?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.95,0:06:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He means you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That includes you!Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.29,0:06:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I tried to stop you, you kept going.Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy you'd go this far to rescue your friend fromDialogue: 50,0:06:37.25,0:06:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is the same one who tried to kill Mr. Iceburg.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I've got some choice words for them!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.43,0:06:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie! We're not gonna let you hog all the glory!Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.06,0:06:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We figured we'd be able to find Mr. Iceburg's assassins if we followed you,Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we hid in the coal car!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.73,0:06:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And... it seems we were right.Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us join you guys in this battle.Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.03,0:07:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And your enemy is, of course...Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the same bastards who took Big Bro Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.74,0:07:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, and we know exactly who they are!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.95,0:07:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, Galley-La, how you gonna make it right if we don't get back our Big Bro?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.75,0:07:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.75,0:07:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Iceburg who's suffered the most!Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you guys talking about?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.75,0:07:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie, fill us in! What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.76,0:07:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right, Paulie.Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.47,0:07:28.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know the true culprit, don't you?Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just tell us.Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.35,0:07:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not that dense.Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.64,0:07:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a rough idea who it is.Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna be surprised.Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.90,0:07:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it probably became obvious when they suddenly vanished.Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.15,0:07:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll tell you straight.Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.49,0:07:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The true identities of those masked men are...Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.91,0:07:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, Kaku, Kalifa and Blueno from the bar.Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.29,0:07:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They tried to kill Mr. Iceburg.Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! It wasn't obvious to you?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-But you said they moved back home!Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At a time like this?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.09,0:08:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We thought it was Michael and Hoichael from the Backstreets.Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.18,0:08:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.93,0:08:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who and who?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.84,0:08:12.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?! You don't know them?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.43,0:08:14.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're famous in the Backstreets!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.02,0:08:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How would I know?! You guys are–Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.06,0:08:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I ate a lot.Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.94,0:08:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm finally full.Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.40,0:08:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then...Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.78,0:08:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Family! Galley-La shipwrights!Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.53,0:08:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We may have had our issues back in town, but we're all after the same enemy now!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.79,0:08:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That pigeon jerk will be the strongest guy we fight.Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.23,0:08:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's mine. I'm gonna kick his ass!Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.63,0:08:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a battle to get back what those four took from us.Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.38,0:08:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, we won't be able to get anything done unless we catch up to them.Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.85,0:08:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Grandma! It's Aqua Laguna!Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? It's here already?Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.19,0:09:01.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney, let me have a look!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.78,0:09:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.28,0:09:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miss Kokoro, shouldn't you be in the engine room right now?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to dodge that huge wave somehow!Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.41,0:09:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't control Rocketman.Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.87,0:09:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we tried to operate it, nothing works, including the brake.Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My job ended once the train got on the railway.Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This train always runs at full throttle.Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one can stop it anymore.Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.76,0:09:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.97,0:09:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do something, or we'll crash into that massive wave! Hey, Luffy–Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we have the same goal...Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it would be dumb to fight separately.Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.52,0:09:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.20,0:09:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it? We're comrades.Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.12,0:09:55.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All our friends...Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.16,0:09:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are in that train up ahead.Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll only get more allies!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.67,0:10:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let a big wave take us down!Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.38,0:10:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll all achieve our goal!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.55,0:10:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.14,0:10:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, guys!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me what you can do about this wave!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.68,0:10:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! Fire all the cannonballs we have at that wave!Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.27,0:10:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When it comes to cannons, leave it to me!Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.57,0:10:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Family! Stand tall against that wave!Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.48,0:10:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prepare the cannons!Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.86,0:10:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Roger! – Roger!Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a move on!Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.37,0:10:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the baby transponder snail!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.40,0:11:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.11,0:11:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain T-Bone!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.57,0:11:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to your arm?Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.11,0:11:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.95,0:11:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I got bitten by a bug earlier. When I scratched the area, it bled.Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's awful! We must stop the bleeding at once!Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make do with this.Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.37,0:11:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Your own cape?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.59,0:11:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, this should do.Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.96,0:11:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When my subordinates bleed, it's my heart that gets wounded.Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone...Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.39,0:11:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,May the world be peaceful and kind again today.Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.02,0:11:52.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,– His face is super scary. – His face is super scary.Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.03,0:11:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.94,0:11:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.45,0:11:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I haven't said anything.Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.82,0:12:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's something I can do, I'll do it, even if my body gets destroyed.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.58,0:12:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The officials in cars six and seven have been wiped out.Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.84,0:12:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In addition, the two criminals detained in car six are missing as well.Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.68,0:12:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't tell whether there's an intruder or if they escaped on their own.Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can this be?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.93,0:12:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tend to the wounded right away and alert everyone to the situation!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.56,0:12:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.15,0:12:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, can you hear me?Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! Is that you, Sanji?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.53,0:12:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things are taking a turn for the worse here.Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn for the worse?Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.87,0:12:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Who's with you?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.33,0:12:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's going on?! Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.79,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks to a certain idiot.Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.46,0:12:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-Idiot?Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Again! What?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sanji?Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this idiot?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.34,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.05,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.64,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,But you look panicky.Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, there are two idiots.Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.35,0:13:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demi-Cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.40,0:13:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Let 'er rip! – Let 'er rip!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.86,0:13:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not even making a dent.Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess it's no surprise.Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.20,0:13:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Those puny cannons won't work!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! Stay back!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.41,0:13:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to the Franky Family's special cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.16,0:13:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Target! Aqua Laguna!Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.29,0:13:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.00,0:13:36.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super Scrap Cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.43,0:13:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand tall!Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep firing!Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.23,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Replenish the cannonballs!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.23,0:13:54.90,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.44,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Aim at the front! Focus on one spot!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.44,0:14:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! Focus pocus!Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do your best.Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.61,0:14:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The railway floats a little bit, but not enough to go over Aqua Laguna.Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.87,0:14:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we slam into it head-on, even Rocketman will be scrap metal.Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna die?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.42,0:14:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you to prepare yourselves, right?Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.05,0:14:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Us too?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.72,0:14:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then Robin is still...Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sure sounds lively over there.Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.64,0:14:35.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, Sanji...Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.19,0:14:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fill you in on Robin's reasoning...Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and our current situation, so...Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.82,0:14:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sanji.Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.83,0:14:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything about the reason for Robin's actions and our current situation.Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.96,0:14:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So listen closely.Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We're gonna die!Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Less whining, more firing!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.88,0:15:05.84,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Find a way out!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.51,0:15:11.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Zoro.Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.28,0:15:27.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Keep firing at the front!Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.49,0:15:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.42,0:15:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fire our own...Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.80,0:15:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,cannon.Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's 108 times 2?Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 216.Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, 216...Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.48,0:16:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a mouthful.Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, pick whatever.Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.94,0:16:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are they doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.57,0:16:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What can they do with their fists and some swords?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They told us to keep firing.Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.91,0:16:12.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough talking! Just back them up!Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then... 300!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.67,0:16:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Hundred-Pound...Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We're gonna crash! – We're gonna crash!Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.85,0:16:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...Cannon! – ...Cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.61,0:17:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– W-We got through! – W-We got through!Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.83,0:17:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We got through Aqua Laguna! – We got through Aqua Laguna!Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna die!Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.87,0:18:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you okay, Nami?Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, somehow...Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.50,0:18:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was really something.Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.25,0:18:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't call themselves pirates for nothing.Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to be their enemy,Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.34,0:18:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they sure make dependable allies!Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.72,0:18:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Straw Hat! – Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.26,0:18:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I thought we were dead.Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What incredible guys...Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.06,0:18:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not through the storm yet!Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.85,0:18:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.56,0:18:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we're afraid of now!Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.66,0:18:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was fun!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.28,0:18:59.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! You're amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.03,0:19:02.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was some superhuman power!Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.29,0:19:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, get over here.Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji.Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you, Luffy?Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's it going over there?Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Robin?Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.89,0:19:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin is still in their custody.Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.06,0:19:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami just brought me up to speed.Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.11,0:19:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard everything.Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.36,0:19:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.99,0:19:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... that's what's going on.Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and give them hell.Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.03,0:19:43.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be reckless, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell him to wait until we catch up!Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.50,0:19:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, cook! Can you hear me?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are some crazy guys over there–Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said it's fine.Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.63,0:19:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro...Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What would you do if it were you?Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.55,0:20:02.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After hearing how Robin lied and was arrested to save us,Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.72,0:20:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,could you just stay put?Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use trying to stop him.Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know me well.Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moss Head!Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.53,0:20:16.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about me?Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.53,0:20:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get real, dumbass!Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately...Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.53,0:20:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,after hearing how Robin was feeling...Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even if our captain ordered it...Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.62,0:20:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no way I'd stop!Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you break it?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.13,0:20:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask Straw Hat something, too!Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.34,0:20:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who cares?Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.01,0:20:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should've told me beforehand.Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I didn't tell you, wasn't it obvious?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so arrogant!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not being arrogant.Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.65,0:20:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'll be okay.Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.65,0:20:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lady! Have the train go even faster!Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even faster?Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.65,0:21:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Like, more whooosh!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.37,0:21:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's already exceeded its speed limit...Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.62,0:21:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and it can no longer stop on its own.Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, while I was away...Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.93,0:21:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all of this was happening?Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin doesn't know about the Merry...Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.31,0:21:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or the huge fight between you and Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.48,0:21:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In order for all six of us, including you, to stay safe,Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.49,0:21:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she sacrificed herself and obeyed their orders.Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.24,0:21:49.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She did it for us.Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.79,0:21:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a moving story!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.75,0:21:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.76,0:22:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dummy! I'm not crying!Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.47,0:22:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I can't believe it!Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.18,0:22:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is supposed to be a cruel, savage, she-devil!Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.06,0:22:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in reality, she's got a soft spot for her friends!Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.44,0:22:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin is within a stone's throw.Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.19,0:22:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to rescue her!Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.40,0:22:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well said!Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.36,0:22:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the boss of the Franky Family, the Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.37,0:22:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hand, eyebrow bro!Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.87,0:22:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I've got my own reasons for keeping Robin out of government custody.Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.37,0:22:37.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most of all, when I hear such a touching story...!Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Let's go, Long Nose!Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.42,0:22:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.92,0:22:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not coming.Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.39,0:22:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It no longer has anything to do with me, right?Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.14,0:22:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the World Government itself becomes your enemy at last,Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.31,0:22:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be part of it.Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.90,0:22:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll join with Luffy and the others as well, right?Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.27,0:23:02.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all my blustering, and after humiliating myself,Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.11,0:23:04.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how could I stand alongside you guys?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.49,0:23:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about Robin,Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.37,0:23:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'm no longer under any obligation to go save her!Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.46,0:23:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I left the Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya.Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.68,0:23:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! What do you mean "see ya"?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.14,0:23:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got nowhere to go!Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.77,0:23:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine.Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.39,0:23:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave him be.Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.15,0:23:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a stubborn idiot.Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.36,0:23:43.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Search every nook and cranny!Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.28,0:23:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be some evidence somewhere!Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.57,0:23:47.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This...Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.70,0:23:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.83,0:23:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please make do with this!Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.12,0:23:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Wanze, sir! The train is in a whole lot of trouble!Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.21,0:23:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Pipe down!Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.33,0:24:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,I'm the one who's in a whole lot of trouble!Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.96,0:24:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero, sir! The criminals have escaped!Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.86,0:24:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found them!Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.07,0:24:25.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.78,0:24:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Metallic Star!Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.49,0:24:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Who's there?! – Who's there?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.63,0:24:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He told me everything.Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.13,0:24:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that you men wish to rescue a fair maiden.Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.26,0:24:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That alone is reason enough for me to lend a hand.Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.26,0:24:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall fight alongside you!Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.02,0:25:03.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may call me...Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.36,0:25:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:53.38,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,SogekingDialogue: 1,0:01:50.13,0:01:53.38,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,SogekingDialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:48.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah The Franky Family's Personal King BullsDialogue: 1,0:02:44.52,0:02:48.06,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom and Gomorrah The Franky Family's Personal King BullsDialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:56.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Puffing TomDialogue: 1,0:10:51.30,0:10:56.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Puffing TomDialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:11.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car FiveDialogue: 1,0:11:07.44,0:11:11.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car FiveDialogue: 50,0:11:29.46,0:11:39.05,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Justice"Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:46.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone Marine Headquarters Hobby: Saving People   Motto: 100 Good Deeds A DayDialogue: 1,0:11:40.43,0:11:46.89,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone Marine Headquarters Hobby: Saving People   Motto: 100 Good Deeds A DayDialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:19.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Puffing TomDialogue: 1,0:21:16.13,0:21:19.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Puffing TomDialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:52.29,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car Seven InteriorDialogue: 1,0:23:48.91,0:23:52.29,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car Seven InteriorDialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:59.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car Four (Kitchen)Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.00,0:23:59.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car Four (Kitchen)Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.00,0:23:59.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car Four (Kitchen)Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car ThreeDialogue: 2,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car ThreeDialogue: 2,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Car ThreeDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDia